Fork: Fork the repo
Fork -> Concept

Concept: Add concept to\nconcepts.json
Concept -> Generator

Generator: Write Go\ngenerator
Generator -> Fuzz

Fuzz: Write fuzz test\n(1000 samples)
Fuzz -> Validate

Validate: Run graph\nvalidator
Validate -> PR

PR: Open pull request
PR -> CI

CI: CI passes? {
  shape: diamond
}

CI -> Review: Yes

Review: Maintainer review
Review -> Merge

Merge: Merged!

CI -> Fix: No {
  style.stroke: "#B53333"
}

Fix: Fix issues
Fix -> PR

*.style: {
  fill: "transparent"
  font-color: "#141413"
  border-radius: 6
  stroke: "#6b6a64"
}
